** setting based on the specific requirements of each writing task, striking a balance between creativity and relevance.  **Tips and Tricks for Mastering the Application AI Interface**  Ready to become a power user of the Application AI Interface? Here are a few tips and tricks to help you get the most out of it:  *   **Start with Categorization:** Before you start analyzing your data, take the time to properly categorize your AI usage. This will make it much easier to filter and sort your data and identify meaningful patterns. *   **Experiment with Different Timeframes:** Don't just look at your data over the past week or month. Experiment with different timeframes to see how your usage has changed over time and identify long-term trends. *   **Pay Attention to Token Consumption:** Keep a close eye on your **Token** consumption and identify areas where you can optimize your prompts to reduce costs. *   **Don't Be Afraid to Experiment:** The best way to learn how to use the Application AI Interface is to experiment with it. Try different filters, sorts, and visualizations to see what insights you can uncover. *   **Share Your Findings:** Share your findings with your team and encourage them to use the Application AI Interface to improve their AI usage.  **The Future of AI Usage Tracking**  The Application AI Interface is constantly evolving, with new features and capabilities being added all the time. We're committed to providing you with the tools you need to understand and optimize your AI usage, and we're excited to see what you can achieve with it.  Expect to see future iterations include features like:  *   **Automated Prompt Optimization Suggestions:** The system will analyze your prompts and suggest improvements to reduce **Token** consumption or improve output quality. *   **Predictive Analytics:** The system will predict your future AI usage based on historical data, allowing you to anticipate resource needs and proactively manage costs. *   **Integration w